# The Vortex web instance this desktop shell loads.
#
# No path. Upstream serves the Stoat client at `stoat.chat/app`, and this file
# inherited that `/app` — but this deployment serves the client at the ROOT.
# `pi-infra/infra/vortex/Caddyfile` diverts only `/api`, `/ws`, `/autumn`,
# `/january`, `/livekit` and `/ingress`; everything else reaches the client
# container. A `/app` here would open a route the React client does not have:
# it derives navigation from `pathname`, and `/app` is not one of the
# destinations in the `Local` union.
#
# CI takes this from the `VORTEX_APP_URL` repository variable instead, and
# `vite.main.config.ts` fails the build when it is missing — a wrong default
# would ship a shell pointed at somebody else's server.
VORTEX_APP_URL=https://vortex.example.com
